WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Our current prototype estimates a blade’s 3D change
from supplied healthy geometry and matching images.

00:12.000 --> 00:30.000
Input: a healthy 3D blade, seven matching image pairs,
and a supplied mapping between pictures and surface points.

00:30.000 --> 00:48.000
Compare known synthetic change with the saved prediction.
The model also changes places that should stay healthy.

00:48.000 --> 01:04.000
The 3D predictor and real-photo detector are separate components.
These are actual saved outputs, not new inference.

01:04.000 --> 01:20.000
Latest check: 3 of 18 learned-model cases and 4 of 18 fixed-rule cases
passed every improvement check. Reliability remains unresolved.

01:20.000 --> 01:36.000
Planned: more reliable 3D estimates and a separate test of whether
3D-assisted training improves inspection of real photographs.
